== confound-makeup enumeration ==
STATUS: AUTHORITATIVE (2026-08-21). Supersedes nothing; this file is the plan of
record for results/screening-batch1-confound-makeup/ and the derivation of the
cell list hard-coded in scripts/screening-batch1-makeup-driver.sh --profile confound.

WHAT THIS ENUMERATES. Every archived evidence run that is TRUNCATED — a
truncating stop reason, or an absent/zero-byte agent-solution.diff — and that no
later untruncated run of the SAME (task, configuration, rep) has replaced. A
truncated run is not evidence about the model: the harness stopped it. Grading
such a cell would convert a harness fault into a model result.

Non-evidence datasets (smoke*, pilot-reference, revalidation,
screening-batch1-aborted) are excluded from both sides: they neither count as
evidence nor supersede a lost sample.

Reproduce:  .venv/bin/python -m harness.analysis.archive results --truncated

